{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2021-10-05 02:00:00', 'title': 'WABTEC SECURES €60M ORDER FOR PLATFORM GATES TO SUPPORT THE MARSEILLE NEOMMA METRO AUTOMATION PROJECT', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) IS TO SUPPLY PLATFORM GATES TO MARSEILLE'S METRO AUTOMATION PROJECT. THE DEAL, VALUED AT €60M, IS PART OF PLANS BY FRANCE'S SECOND CITY TO UPGRADE AND AUTOMATE ITS LOCAL TRANSPORT NETWORK. WABTEC'S FAIVELEY TRANSPORT, ALONG WITH EIFFAGE GENIE CIVIL MÉDITERRANÉE AND EIFFAGE ENERGIE SYSTEMS MEDITERRANEE, WILL SUPPLY METROPOLE AIX MARSEILLE PROVENCE WITH ALL THE PLATFORM GATES FOR LINES 1 AND 2 OF MARSEILLE NEOMMA, THAT ARE BEING AUTOMATE"}